            "Built-in preset — cannot be deleted.\n"
            f"Loads a {patches}-patch ColorMunki recipe with Triple density on:\n"
            f"targen -d2 -f{patches} -e{white} -B{black} -G -g{grey}\n"
            "printtarg -ii1 -pA4R -T300 -L -a1.30 -m5 -M5 -b -P\n"
